35,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The quotes are in. Meeting space costs 141,000 yen. Kitchen is 96,000. The crumbs are under three keyboards. We are eating at our desks.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the invoices. We paid 68,000 yen for nine small bookings. The wall is just plasterboard; sound travels easily.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"I found the tally! The two people nearest the door used it eleven times, but everyone else only four. And the fridge? Half the food was nobody’s!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I found that our unplanned talk now happens only by the printer, and the last difficult conversation was forced across open desks, leaving silence for weeks.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Eleven callouts for equipment rooms, zero for the empty one. The lunch trip is twenty-five minutes, three days a week. That is a lot of lost time.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, the wall is useless. Sound travels. @Toshio, twenty-five minutes is a waste. We need a decision.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. The wall is thin. But look at the invoices. We paid 68,000 yen for small groups. We need to see the full cost before deciding.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, the fridge was a mess! Half the food was nobody’s, and one person cleaned it twice. We need rules so that doesn’t happen again!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, that silence after the open confrontation was painful. We need a place where difficult words can be spoken without an audience.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Servas, the silence is a symptom. The callouts show equipment fails, not people. I need to know if the hours spent fixing things outweigh the hours lost to walking.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, a quiet room costs nothing. The kitchen is 96,000 yen. The meeting space is 141,000. We cannot afford the noise.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the quiet room costs nothing, but we are already paying 68,000 yen for outside hire. I need to see if that stops if we fix this.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, I agree! We need a place to talk without everyone staring. But @Shion, the kitchen is cheaper! Can we just eat there?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, a kitchen invites noise, not the quiet needed for difficult truths. We must choose a space that protects our dignity, not just our appetites.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
